{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16756","headline":"送刘秀才南归 · 陈存","name":"送刘秀才南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟啼杨柳垂，此别千万里。\n古路入商山，春风去灞水。\n停车落日在，罢酒离人起。\n蓬户寄龙沙，送归情讵已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}